---
import DocLayout from '../layouts/DocLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<DocLayout title="Viewport">
  <h1>Viewport</h1>
  <p>
    Scene Light Manager (SLM) features high-performance viewport tools that allow you to adjust lights, rotate HDRI skies, and isolate illumination sources directly in the 3D viewport under your mouse cursor, avoiding N-Panel slider hunting.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Interactive HDRI & Sky Rotation</h2>
  <div class="mb-4">
    <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-semibold shadow-inner">Ctrl + Alt + RMB</kbd>
  </div>
  <p class="mb-4">
    Instead of editing shader mapping nodes or diving into World tabs to rotate environment maps, SLM provides real-time Z-axis rotation shortcuts directly in the viewport. Press and hold the hotkey and drag horizontally to activate the rotation modal.
  </p>

  <!-- HDRI Rotation and Strength Viewport Overlays -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <img 
          src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/world_rotation.png`} 
          alt="World Rotation Viewport Overlay" 
          class="h-auto max-h-[150px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Interactive World Z-Rotation rotation overlay</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <img 
          src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/world_strength.png`} 
          alt="World Strength Viewport Overlay" 
          class="h-auto max-h-[150px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Interactive World Strength multiplier overlay</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-white mt-0 mb-4 text-sm font-mono tracking-wider">Keyboard & Mouse Controls</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="bg-technical-amber/20 text-technical-amber border border-technical-amber/30 px-2 py-1 rounded font-mono text-[10px] shrink-0">Ctrl + Alt + RMB (Drag)</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-white block">Trigger Rotation</strong>
          Hold the keys and drag the mouse horizontally in the viewport to rotate the active sky coordinate system.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="bg-white/10 text-white border border-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded font-mono text-[10px] shrink-0">Left Click or Enter</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-white block">Confirm Action</strong>
          Saves the current rotation angle.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 border border-red-500/30 px-2 py-1 rounded font-mono text-[10px] shrink-0">Escape or Right Click</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-white block">Cancel & Reset</strong>
          Discards changes and resets coordinates to their initial values.
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive HDRI Rotation Modal Sub-controls -->
  <div class="p-5 bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/10 transition-colors mb-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <span class="text-white font-semibold block text-sm">Interactive HDRI Rotation Modal Sub-controls</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-400 text-xs font-mono mt-1 block">Context: Active during k_tools.rotate_hdri modal loop</span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mt-4 text-xs text-zinc-200">
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1 font-semibold">TAB</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Cycles adjustment property sub-mode:
          <code class="text-[10px] text-zinc-300 font-mono block mt-1">ROTATION &rarr; STRENGTH &rarr; SUN_INTENSITY (Nishita only) &rarr; SUN_ELEVATION (Nishita only)</code>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1 font-semibold">R</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Resets the current active property back to its factory default value (Rotation: <code class="text-zinc-300 font-mono">0.0°</code>, Strength: <code class="text-zinc-300 font-mono">1.0</code>, Sun Intensity: <code class="text-zinc-300 font-mono">1.0</code>, Sun Elevation: <code class="text-zinc-300 font-mono">5.0°</code>).
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1 font-semibold">Shift / Ctrl (Drag Mouse)</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Normal horizontal drag controls standard adjustment speed. Hold <kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded">Shift</kbd> for precision mode (0.1x adjustment speed) or <kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded">Ctrl</kbd> for stepped snapping (snaps in increments of 5°).
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1 font-semibold">Confirming & Exiting</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Confirm and save adjustments with <kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded">L-Click</kbd>, <kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded">Enter</kbd>, or by releasing the mouse (if hold-drag triggered). Cancel and revert all changes with <kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded">R-Click</kbd> or <kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded">Esc</kbd>.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Smart Context Detection</h3>
  <p>
    The rotation operator dynamically evaluates the active scene setup:
  </p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Nishita Sky Active</strong>
      Rotates the native Sun Angle coordinate.
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Custom HDRI mapping</strong>
      Drives rotation of Z-axis inputs in the Mapping Node.
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Material Preview Mode</strong>
      Drives native viewport studio HDRI rotation values.
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>2. Viewport Gizmo Buttons</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">
    Selecting any light source in the scene reveals a row of floating, transparent viewport button overlays next to the object pivot.
  </p>

  <!-- Viewport Gizmos Image -->
  <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl mb-6 group hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-3 flex justify-center">
      <img 
        src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/viewport_2d_gizmos.png`} 
        alt="Viewport Gizmo Buttons" 
        class="h-auto max-h-[250px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.01] zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] block font-mono text-center">Interactive floating viewport gizmos for quick type, shape, and size adjustments</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs mb-6">
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Type Selector (Lightbulb)</strong>
      Cycles the light source type (Area, Point, Spot, Sun).
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Shape Cycles (Square/Circle)</strong>
      Toggles Area light geometries (Square, Disk, Rectangle, Ellipse).
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Size Controller (Arrows)</strong>
      Click and drag to scale physical dimensions or radius.
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
      <strong class="text-white block mb-2 font-mono">Beam/Spread (Concentric Circles)</strong>
      Click and drag to scale Area spread angles or Spot blending limits.
    </div>
  </div>

  <blockquote>
    <p>
      <strong>[NOTE] Customizing Gizmos:</strong> You can toggle individual button visibility, change sizes, spaces, offsets, and transparency settings under the Addon Preferences.
    </p>
  </blockquote>

  <!-- Gizmo Drag sensitivity parameters -->
  <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl mb-6 hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
    <strong class="text-zinc-300 font-semibold block mb-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">Gizmo Drag Modifiers & Sensitivity</strong>
    <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Clicking and dragging on the <strong>Size</strong>, <strong>Intensity (Power)</strong>, or <strong>Beam/Spread</strong> buttons activates a relative drag adjuster. Use these keys to alter sensitivity and targets during drag actions:
    </p>
    <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-normal text-zinc-200">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
        <span class="text-zinc-300">Normal Drag</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-400 font-light font-mono text-[10px]">Default sensitivity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
        <span class="text-zinc-200 font-sans flex items-center gap-1"><kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold text-amber-400">Shift</kbd> + Drag</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Precision adjustments (Extra smooth)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
        <span class="text-zinc-200 font-sans flex items-center gap-1"><kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold text-amber-400">Ctrl</kbd> + Drag</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-400 font-light font-sans">Large adjustments (Fast speed)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
        <span class="text-zinc-200 font-sans flex items-center gap-1"><kbd class="font-mono text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold text-amber-400">Alt</kbd> + Drag</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-medium">Adjusts property for <strong>all selected lights</strong> simultaneously</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
        <span class="text-zinc-300">Confirm Action</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Release mouse button, click LMB, or press Enter</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
        <span class="text-zinc-300">Cancel & Revert</span>
        <span class="text-zinc-400 font-light">Press Escape (Esc) or RMB to restore original settings</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>3. Quick Popup Menu</h2>
  <div class="mb-4 flex gap-2">
    <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-semibold shadow-inner">Y</kbd>
    <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-semibold shadow-inner">Alt + Y</kbd>
  </div>
  <p class="mb-6">
    Pressing the hotkey in the 3D viewport spawns a complete parameters editor card directly at your mouse coordinates:
  </p>

  <!-- Quick Y Popup Menu Tabs Gallery -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img 
          src={`${base}panel_images/quick_action_panel-y_panel.png`} 
          alt="Y Menu - Settings Tab" 
          class="h-full w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-white text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Settings Tab</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img 
          src={`${base}panel_images/quick_action_panel-y_panel-nodes.png`} 
          alt="Y Menu - Nodes Tab" 
          class="h-full w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-white text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">Nodes Tab</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img 
          src={`${base}panel_images/quick_action_panel-y_panel-world.png`} 
          alt="Y Menu - World Tab" 
          class="h-full w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="text-white text-[10px] font-mono block text-center">World Tab</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="space-y-4 mb-6">
    <li>
      <strong class="text-white block">SETTINGS Tab</strong>
      Offers quick adjustments for color temperatures, exposures, intensities, rig controls, constraints, and visibility toggles. You can also assign the active light to an existing Light Set or use the <strong>New Set from Selected</strong> option to instantly group all currently selected viewport objects into a newly created tracking collection.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong class="text-white block">NODES Tab</strong>
      Enables nodes, binds Gobo structures, loads projection maps, and displays shader preview rendering thumbnails.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong class="text-white block">WORLD Tab</strong>
      Swaps background HDRI maps, manages Nishita Sky presets, and drives Z-rotations.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <!-- Studio Presets Menu Detail -->
  <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300 mb-6">
    <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-3 font-mono">STUDIO PRESETS MENU (Alt + Y)</strong>
    <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Pressing <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs border border-white/10">Alt + Y</kbd> in the 3D viewport instantly spawns the Studio Lights presets selection menu directly at your cursor:
    </p>
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-3 flex justify-center max-w-[280px] mx-auto">
      <img 
        src={`${base}panel_images/preset_menu.png`} 
        alt="Studio Lights Menu dropdown" 
        class="h-auto max-h-[220px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
      This floating dropdown enables rapid loading of preset light configurations (such as the 3-Point Light Rig, Studio Duo, Warm-Cool Split, etc.) without having to cycle tabs or navigate sidebar panels.
    </p>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>4. Smart Light Isolation (Solo Mode)</h2>
  <p>
    Mutes all other lights in the scene instantly to isolate and tweak the active light source's shadows and color bounces.
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li>
      <strong>Activation:</strong> Click the Star/Solo button on the sidebar list or click the Star icon in the Viewport Gizmo.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>State Preservation:</strong> All original visibility statuses are cached. Toggling solo mode off returns the scene to its exact prior visibility layout.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Mute HDRI:</strong> Configurable preference to automatically black out world backgrounds while soloing lights to analyze light leaks.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>5. Interactive Light Placement (Pointer)</h2>
  <div class="mb-4">
    <kbd class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-semibold shadow-inner">Shift + Y</kbd>
  </div>
  <p class="mb-6">
    Project lights precisely onto your geometry. Selecting a light and activating pointer placement snaps and aligns the light source along the normals of surfaces under your cursor, pointing directly at the target highlight area. Useful for creating cinematic hair highlights, precise rim accents, and character eye specular spots.
  </p>

  <!-- Light Alignment Modal Overlay Showcase Image -->
  <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl mb-6 group hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-3 flex justify-center">
      <img 
        src={`${base}overlay_gizmos/light_alignment-modal-overlay_showcase.png`} 
        alt="Interactive Light Placement Pointer Overlay" 
        class="h-auto max-h-[350px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.01] zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] block font-mono text-center">Viewport overlay during pointer placement and light targeting mode</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Light Placement Modal Sub-controls -->
  <div class="p-5 bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/10 transition-colors mb-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <span class="text-white font-semibold block text-sm">Interactive Light Placement Modal Sub-controls</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-400 text-xs font-mono mt-1 block">Context: Active during k_tools.light_at_point modal loop</span>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3 mt-4 text-xs text-zinc-200">
      <!-- Viewport modes -->
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono block mb-1 font-semibold">TAB</span>
          <span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal font-sans">Cycles targeting modes: Reflective, Orbiting focus, or Direct Normal alignment.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-200 shrink-0">
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10">REFLECT</span>
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10">ORBIT</span>
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10">DIRECT</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mouse Scroll Wheel Combos -->
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-semibold block mb-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">Mouse Scroll Combinations</span>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs font-normal">
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
            <span class="text-zinc-200 font-sans">Adjust Power / Energy</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Scroll Wheel</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-1">
            <span class="text-zinc-200 font-sans">Adjust Emitter Size</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Shift + Scroll</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between md:border-none pb-1 md:pb-0">
            <span class="text-zinc-200 font-sans">Adjust Distance (scales energy if Smart Calculations is enabled)</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Alt + Scroll</kbd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-zinc-200 font-sans">Adjust Spread / Blend</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Ctrl + Scroll</kbd>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Light Types and Shapes -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-zinc-300 font-mono block mb-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">Switch Light Type</span>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 font-mono text-[10px]">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Point</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">1</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Sun</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">2</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Spot</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">3</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Area</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">4</kbd></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-zinc-300 font-mono block mb-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">Switch Area Shape</span>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 font-mono text-[10px]">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Square</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">S</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Rectangle</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">R</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Disk</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">D</kbd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-zinc-300 font-sans font-normal">Ellipse</span> <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded text-amber-400 font-semibold">E</kbd></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Toggles -->
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-mono block mb-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">Auxiliary Actions</span>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-sans text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal">Toggle Emitter Visibility</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">H</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal">Toggle Solo / Isolate Mode</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Shift + H</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1 md:border-none md:pb-0"><span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal">Link Receiver under cursor (Light Linking)</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">L</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1 md:border-none md:pb-0"><span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal">Link Blocker under cursor (Shadow Linking)</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">Shift + L</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center col-span-1 md:col-span-2 mt-1 pt-1 border-t border-white/5"><span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal">Pause Projection (lock position to adjust parameters)</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">P</kbd></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Confirming & Exiting -->
      <div class="bg-black/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-mono block mb-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest">Confirming & Exiting</span>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-sans text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal">Confirm & Save</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">LMB / Enter / Space</kbd></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-zinc-200 font-normal">Cancel & Revert</span> <kbd class="font-mono text-amber-400 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded font-semibold">RMB / Esc</kbd></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

